                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Hello. I need to get to Liverpool by 11 o’clock for a conference. Do you have any buses that arrive there by then?\\nB: I’m afraid we don’t. Our buses make stops at other bus terminals, so they take a little longer.\\nA: Do you know if there’s a bus company that goes straight to Liverpool?\\nB: Actually, there is. Across the street from here, there’s another terminal with several express buses. I’m sure one of them goes straight to Liverpool.\"}]]}]]}"
